      "message": "I\u0027m not too familiar with the metrics collection pipeline, but given that we don\u0027t know which soong_build invocation will run in any given build, I think gradually putting together the \"full\" metrics proto this way isn\u0027t a recipe for happiness.\n\nAFAIU it\u0027s even possible for soong_build invocations (e.g. queryview, JSON graph, build.ninja generation) to run in parallel, which makes the \"one file\" solution even more dicey.\n\nSo yes, a separate file for each soong_build invocation sounds much more reasonable. If one wants a single proto for all soong_build invocations, one can always merge them in soong_ui or the uploader.",
